      "MERCY: I be The Witch of the Wood.\nTHOMASIN: Mercy, come out.\nMERCY: I be not Mercy, I be The Witch of the Wood. I have come to steal ye! Hear me stick a-flying through the trees: clickety-clackety-clickety- c…",
